{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["An altar of earth you shall make for Me — because the idolaters would make their asherim on the altars. As written regarding Gideon: ״ואת האשרה אשר עליו תכרת״, and written regarding Zechariah: ״בניהם מזבחותם ואשריהם״ and so forth, ״לא תטע לך אשרה כל עץ אצל מזבח״. Therefore the Holy One, blessed be He, says: even if you make for Me an altar, you shall make it only of earth, for they are not accustomed to make designs and images except in smooth craftsmanship. And even if you wish to make an altar of stones — אבנים שלמות תבנה את מזבח ה' אלהיך, מזבח אבנים לא תניף עליהם ברזל, as written in Mishneh Torah."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {0 "The citation 'as written regarding Zechariah' (בזכר) is uncertain: the verse quoted (בניהם מזבחותם ואשריהם) does not correspond to the prophet Zechariah, and may refer to an unknown source or reflect a textual corruption."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:42:19.101167731Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}